    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LUST &amp; MAGIC \u2728 is an adult visual novel with point-and-click exploration, placing you in the role of a rebellious wizard who\u2019s just inherited an ancient academy. Guided by Freya (appearing as a mysterious cat), you begin restoring its halls, recruiting your first student, and testing the boundaries of the Ministry\u2019s outdated magical system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through nearby locations to gather resources and uncover secrets, encountering characters like merchant, innkeeper, herbalist, a local fisherman, and Silvana\u2014who shares your first intimate scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Magic &amp; Quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn basic spells from your spellbook and undertake brief side quests, including banishing an elemental threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academy Restoration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair portions of the castle, attract your first aspiring mage, Athena, and help her gather items via point-and-click mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steamy Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > enjoy adult scenes that deepen your wizard\u2019s personal journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the fate of your fledgling academy in LUST &amp; MAGIC \u2728, and prepare for the rising conflict as you challenge the magical world\u2019s status quo.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LUST &amp; MAGIC \u2728 is an adult visual novel with point-and-click exploration, placing you in the role of a rebellious wizard who\u2019s just inherited an ancient academy. Guided by Freya (appearing as a mysterious cat), you begin restoring its halls, recruiting your first student, and testing the boundaries of the Ministry\u2019s outdated magical system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet and Explore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through nearby locations to gather resources and uncover secrets, encountering characters like merchant, innkeeper, herbalist, a local fisherman, and Silvana\u2014who shares your first intimate scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Magic &amp; Quests</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn basic spells from your spellbook and undertake brief side quests, including banishing an elemental threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Academy Restoration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair portions of the castle, attract your first aspiring mage, Athena, and help her gather items via point-and-click mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steamy Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > enjoy adult scenes that deepen your wizard\u2019s personal journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the fate of your fledgling academy in LUST &amp; MAGIC \u2728, and prepare for the rising conflict as you challenge the magical world\u2019s status quo.</p>",
